      "sourceTextSha256": "70941686f1c17421f86bc56296ae8b802b52e6fb67c9654bbd549b69064907dd",
      "text": "\n\n## What the itinerary covers\n\nPanama lies between the Pacific Ocean and the Caribbean Sea, and this four-day itinerary brings together city sights, nature and history. In Panama City, you’ll see the ruins of Panama Viejo, the colonial quarter of Casco Antiguo and the modern city. In the Antón Valley, the town sits inside an ancient volcanic caldera. On the Caribbean coast, the main stops are the San Lorenzo nature reserve, the Spanish fort on a cliff and the new Agua Clara locks of the Panama Canal.\n",
